          "chapter": "Chapter III: A Caucus-Race and a Long Tale",
          "chapterId": "c-0003",
          "paragraph": 727,
          "paragraphId": "p-000728",
          "excerpt": "The King looked anxiously at the White Rabbit, who said in a low voice, “Your Majesty must cross-examine _this_ witness.”"
